WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.490
- Do you know what the
best universities are

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:05.160
to get into a consulting
firm like McKinsey?

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.640
There are many opinions on that,

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.740
which are often based on gut feeling.

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:11.230
So let me try to bring
some objectivity into it

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:13.800
by looking into LinkedIn employment data.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:14.770
So based on LinkedIn,

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:17.190
these are the top four universities

00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:19.130
that current McKinsey employees attended.

00:00:19.130 --> 00:00:20.850
Number one is INSEAD,

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.770
the French and Singapore business school

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.420
offering MBAs and Masters in Management.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:28.450
Harvard Business School, trust
this needs no introduction.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:29.790
Number three is Wharton School

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.660
from University of Pennsylvania.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:34.030
And number four is London
School of Economics.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.180
Does this surprise you?

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.630
Let me know in the comments.

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.180
Follow me for more consulting content

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.207
and career advice.

